      "text": "How can I read a book? Well, if it is not online, it is not an e-book, I can take a book, like I am doing right now, I will take a book. And with my phone I have an app, there is a tool that is called Be My Eyes and I can take a picture of the book, maybe the title or maybe inside the book, I can take a picture and the phone reads it for me. So Be My Eyes is an app that helps me to do any work that I have to do. As you know, journalists develop or we have to develop many tasks and there is investigating, like I was saying, there is reading a lot of information but there is an essential one that is writing.",
